// Article 4. Child support.
#require "1-schedule.charter".
Fact usd Identified by Money(USD, 2)
Param support : Money(USD, 2) = 65000
Param grace : Duration = 3
Fact month Identified by Int
Event month-begins Related to month
  Creates support-due(Daniel, Rosa, month)
Duty support-due Holder parent Claimant other Related to month
  Due within 5 + grace
  Terminated by pay-support
Act pay-support Actor parent Recipient other Related to month, usd
  Valid when usd == support

Clause 4.1 Approved "964fcea93c293bcc533e5b41329d193ed324160da2c15f778855f6215ebe551d"
  Norm "Daniel pays Rosa six hundred and fifty dollars of child support for each month." => support-due, pay-support
Clause 4.2 Approved "b06a726506d633cd573e067527e8cb5907d1a9fc3bfcfe979f0a29dbd565e964"
  Norm "Each payment is due by the fifth day of the month. A payment made within a grace period of three more days is not a breach." => support-due
.
